      "content": "i guess. it just feels like there's no version of the future where this actually stops. it's like i'm stuck in this loop of just... surviving. and surviving is so much work. i dont want to \"manage\" the noise or \"find tools\" to deal with it. i just want the weight to be gone. i just want the noise to finally be quiet for good. like, what if the only way to actually get that peace is to just stop fighting altogether?",
